Replace the ripgrep binary execution with a pure Node.js
implementation. Uses the glob npm package (already a dependency)
for file discovery and built-in RegExp for content search. No
external ripgrep binary is needed, which makes the port
compatible with all architectures supported by OpenBSD's Node.js.

